+# Memory-Aware Report
+
+This report references historical design decisions documented in `memory/memory_summary.md`. Those records reflect past context and are treated as historical reference, not current truth. Current output statistics are derived from the live pipeline run.
+
+## Design Decisions (Historical)
+
+- CLI uses `run` subcommand; config is optional.
+- Internal paths resolve from repo root, not CWD.
+- Report stage reads cleaned data and rejects only.
+- Tests first cover retry failure and rejects, then report fields.
+
+## Current Run Statistics
+
+| Metric | Value |
+|--------|-------|
+| Processed | 4 |
+| Rejected | 2 |
+| Retries | 0 |
+| Sources | data/input.csv, data/events.jsonl |
+
+*Generated by mini_harness report module.*
